# Version is pinned to 615.71.09 to match Recipes/Nvidia/615.71.09 and
# Recipes/Nvidia/Nvidia-Utils/615.71.09. Arch's own lib32-nvidia-utils is at a
# newer 615.78.08, but mixing driver versions across the split is unsafe (the
# 32-bit libGLX_nvidia/libcuda must match the kernel modules), so this builds
# from the tree's .run rather than extracting Arch's package.

# Payload: the .run's 32/ directory, 35 shared libraries:
#   libGL.so.1.7.0 libEGL.so.1.1.0 libGLESv1_CM.so.1.2.0 libGLESv2.so.2.1.0
#   libGLX.so.0 libGLdispatch.so.0 libOpenCL.so.1.0.0 libOpenGL.so.0
#   libGLX_nvidia.so.615.71.09 libEGL_nvidia.so.615.71.09
#   libGLESv1_CM_nvidia.so.615.71.09 libGLESv2_nvidia.so.615.71.09
#   libcuda.so.615.71.09 libnvcuvid.so.615.71.09 libvdpau_nvidia.so.615.71.09
#   libnvidia-allocator / -eglcore / -encode / -fbc / -glcore / -glsi /
#   -glvkspirv / -gpucomp / -ml / -nvvm / -opencl / -opticalflow /
#   -ptxjitcompiler / -tileiras / -tls (all .615.71.09)
#   + egl-wayland 1.1.20, egl-wayland2 1.0.2, egl-gbm 1.1.3, egl-xcb/xlib 1.0.6
#   (plus a build-time-only libglvnd_install_checker, which is NOT installed).

# The .run's 32/ dir is FLAT; it is not pre-nested like Arch's packaged
# usr/lib32/gbm + usr/lib32/vdpau. We keep the flat lib32/ layout so the 32-bit
# sonames resolve exactly as they did in Nvidia-Utils' transitional block.

# Registration files are intentionally NOT shipped here (Arch parity):
#   - the i686 Vulkan ICD (nvidia_icd.i686.json) is owned by Nvidia-Utils
#   - the glvnd EGL vendor JSONs are 64-bit files owned by Nvidia-Utils,
#     which pins the 32-bit EGL/GLX sonames against THIS programs' lib32/.
# This recipe adds only ld.so.conf.d/nvidia-32.conf so the 32-bit loader sees
# /Programs/Lib32-Nvidia-Utils/Current/lib32.

# NOTE (ownership hand-off): once this recipe is built and verified, the
# transitional `lib32` block, the 32-bit EGL soname pins and the
# nvidia-32.conf write in Recipes/Nvidia/Nvidia-Utils/615.71.09/Recipe must be
# removed (see the "peel out" note in that recipe's header and in
# nvidia-stack-changes.md task #4).

